    {
      "title": "Key definitions",
      "html": "<p>Learn these definitions exactly as stated \u2014 they are the terms examiners use.</p><ul><li><b>surd</b>: is an irrational root such as $\\sqrt 2$, $\\sqrt 3$, $\\sqrt[3]{5}$</li><li><b>conjugate</b>: of $a+\\sqrt b$ is $a-\\sqrt b$</li></ul>",
